/**
 * "LACORTE" as a Bayer-dithered block mosaic — the way a BBS release
 * flyer drew a wordmark. Generated from a rasterised Noto Sans Display
 * Black, letter-tracked, sampled onto the ramp " ░▒▓█".
 *
 * 96 cells wide rather than 72: it is the masthead's hero now, and at the
 * smaller size the dither had too few cells per stroke to read as tone.
 *
 * Decorative — the readable name is the page's real <h1>.
 */
